    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d93">

                <pb facs="0164" n="104" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg104"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr. Denby</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-08-13"><hi rendition="#italic">August 13,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Yesterday’s instruction referred only to Kutien investigation by two American
                    members concurrently with British. Szechuan investigation may go on as reported
                    in your dispatch 2278, unless you have ground to distrust the result.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adee</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
